%% WYVERN-E — power (light 2S LiPo -> 5V UBEC; recovery is motor-driven, no recovery battery)
%% Regenerated 2026-08. Pack is 450 mAh (Zeee 2S) -> ~40 flights/charge per we4_deepsim.py H.
flowchart LR
    B2[2S LiPo 7.4V ~450mAh] --> SW[arming switch + fuse]
    SW --> BEC[5V/6V UBEC set 5V, 3A]
    BEC --> RAIL[single 5V rail + decoupling: 1000uF bulk @ servos, 100uF + SS34 Schottky hold-up @ VSYS]
    RAIL --> T[Pico 2 W VSYS 1.8-5.5V -> 3V3OUT -> 2x BNO085 + BMP388/BME680 + cam]
    RAIL --> SV[2 TVC servos @ 5V ~1.8 kg-cm vs ~0.56 kg-cm demand]
    B2 --> ADC[GP26/ADC0 100k/62k pack monitor]
    M[F15-4 motor] --> EJ[built-in ejection charge -> bulkhead joint -> chute]
